status GREEN for the scratch measurements: nine splits run, every row-major cell at 112 and 224 lines at the printed floor, and the 96-line cliff read as printed. No witness was run, since the model is untracked and the paper names no code line. Left open: the hashed-index split, the boundary between 96 and 112 lines, and any hardware reading.
recommend check in (Claude) -- the next door is a hashed-index model, which changes the set-mapping and so is a design seam; Keaton's word is needed for a raw vendor event before any hardware claim.
